    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Oðre ungesawene ðing man mot mid aðe gewyrðan, ⁊ syððan be ðam gyldan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Other unseen things [i.e. not on the above list?] may be valued [by the plaintiff] by [taking an] oath, and paid out accordingly.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Cetere res ungesaþene (id est non uise) possunt iuramento comprobari et secundum hoc reddi. Capra duos d.</ab>
      </div>
